<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en-GB">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Funeral Hymns, Poems &amp; Readings | Free Resources | Memories</title>
<meta name="description" content="Funeral hymns, poems, prayers and readings to choose from, plus a plain-English guide to UK bereavement benefits. Free to use, from Memories Funeral Booklets.">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,500;0,600;1,400&family=Inter:wght@300;400;500&family=Italianno&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<meta property="og:locale" content="en_GB">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://memoriesbydd.com/hymns-and-resources/">
<script type="application/ld+json">
{
  "@context": "https://schema.org",
  "@type": "CollectionPage",
  "name": "Hymns, Readings and Guidance",
  "url": "https://memoriesbydd.com/hymns-and-resources/",
  "description": "Funeral hymns, poems, prayers and readings, plus guidance on writing an order of service and claiming UK bereavement support.",
  "isPartOf": { "@type": "WebSite", "name": "Memories Funeral Booklets", "url": "https://memoriesbydd.com/" }
}
</script>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="css/site.css">
<style>
/* ---------- page-local: resource cards ---------- */
.rcards{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1.75rem;margin-top:3.5rem}
.rcard{display:flex;flex-direction:column;border:1px solid var(--border);
  padding:2.5rem 2.25rem;background:var(--bg);transition:.35s var(--ease)}
.rcard:hover{border-color:var(--brand);transform:translateY(-5px);
  box-shadow:0 26px 52px -26px rgba(90,68,40,.32)}
.rcard_n{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:.875rem;color:var(--brand-deep);
  letter-spacing:.1em}
.rcard h3{font-size:1.4375rem;font-weight:400;margin:1rem 0 .875rem;line-height:1.25}
.rcard p{flex:1;font-size:.9375rem;line-height:1.75;color:var(--text-muted)}
.rcard_go{display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:.5rem;margin-top:1.75rem;
  font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.0625rem;color:var(--brand-deep)}
.rcard_go svg{width:18px;height:18px;transition:transform .45s var(--ease-out)}
.rcard:hover .rcard_go svg{transform:translateX(6px)}

.rsoft{margin-top:3.5rem;padding:2rem 2.25rem;background:var(--bg-band);
  display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:1.5rem 2rem}
.rsoft p{font-family:var(--serif);font-size:1.1875rem;max-width:40rem}

@media (max-width:900px){.rcards{grid-template-columns:1fr}}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!--#nav-->

<!-- ═════════════════════════ HEADER ═════════════════════════ -->
<header class="section section--flushBot">
  <div class="wrap">
    <p class="label label--muted" data-anim="up">Resources</p>
    <h1 class="h-display" data-anim="lines" style="font-size:clamp(2.6rem,5vw,4.4rem);margin-top:.75rem">
      Hymns, Readings and <span class="sc">Guidance</span></h1>
    <p class="body measure" data-anim="up" style="--d:160ms;margin-top:1.5rem">Choosing what goes into
    a service is one of the hardest parts of arranging a funeral, and most people are doing it for the
    first time. Everything here is free to use, whether or not you order a booklet from us. Take what
    helps.</p>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ═════════════════════════ THE FOUR ═════════════════════════ -->
<section class="section" data-ambient>
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="rcards" data-stagger="110">
      <a href="/hymns-and-resources/hymns/" class="rcard" data-anim="up">
        <span class="rcard_n">01</span>
        <h3>Funeral hymns</h3>
        <p>The hymns most often sung at UK funerals, with full words you are welcome to use. Browse by
        letter, or tell us the feeling you are after and we will suggest a few.</p>
        <span class="rcard_go">Browse Hymns
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </span>
      </a>

      <a href="/hymns-and-resources/poems-and-readings/" class="rcard" data-anim="up">
        <span class="rcard_n">02</span>
        <h3>Poems, prayers and readings</h3>
        <p>Poems, prayers, psalms and readings for a service or a graveside &mdash; including shorter
        pieces for a child or grandchild to read.</p>
        <span class="rcard_go">Browse Poems and Readings
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </span>
      </a>

      <a href="/hymns-and-resources/what-to-write/" class="rcard" data-anim="up">
        <span class="rcard_n">03</span>
        <h3>What to write in a funeral programme</h3>
        <p>The wording families ask us about most: the running order, a life story, a tribute, and
        acknowledgements.</p>
        <span class="rcard_go">Read the Guide
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </span>
      </a>

      <a href="/hymns-and-resources/funeral-arrangements/" class="rcard" data-anim="up">
        <span class="rcard_n">04</span>
        <h3>UK bereavement benefits and support</h3>
        <p>What financial help exists after a death, who qualifies, and how to claim it. Plain English,
        no jargon.</p>
        <span class="rcard_go">Read the Guide
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M5 12h14M13 6l6 6-6 6"/></svg>
        </span>
      </a>
    </div>

    <!-- The soft CTA is the commercial point of this page. Once, no pressure,
         and once per child page — never twice on the same page.
         ⚠️ "at no extra cost" is flagged in the deck for Ashley to confirm. -->
    <div class="rsoft" data-anim="fade">
      <p>We can set any of these into your loved one&rsquo;s booklet for you, laid out properly, at no
      extra cost.</p>
      <a href="/order/" class="btn">Start Your Booklet</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!--#footer-->
</body>
</html>
